  "hunting White Base,",
  "he was given the new space",
  "battleship Zanzibar for the task.",
  "A front is the basic concept",
  "of deploying forces in battle.",
  "Considering supply, the danger",
  "of encirclement and so on,",
  "having an enemy behind you",
  "is, militarily speaking,",
  "simply bad.",
  "So troops are deployed in a band",
  "within a safe zone.",
  "By pushing this band (called",
  "the front) up toward the danger",
  "zone (where the enemy is),",
  "the enemy stays always in front,",
  "and even when defending, you",
  "are harder to break through.",
  "This idea had existed as military",
